        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles is a classic brutal platform game where you will not escape death! You will need to bring your best game skills to complete the short but challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenging level can be completed within a few seconds, making the pace of the game pretty fast, but the difficulty level ramps up swiftly and completing a level on the first try will be a rare event</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles tells the story of the Meganoid family tree going all the way back to Grandpa's time and is a throw back to the age of tomb raiding and lost civilizations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platform action in short bite size levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel-art retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred levels in normal mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing chiptune sound track</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles is a classic brutal platform game where you will not escape death! You will need to bring your best game skills to complete the short but challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenging level can be completed within a few seconds, making the pace of the game pretty fast, but the difficulty level ramps up swiftly and completing a level on the first try will be a rare event</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles tells the story of the Meganoid family tree going all the way back to Grandpa's time and is a throw back to the age of tomb raiding and lost civilizations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platform action in short bite size levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel-art retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred levels in normal mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing chiptune sound track</p></li></ul>",
